WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.472
Read the latest reply with its conversation
nearby.

00:00:03.472 --> 00:00:08.996
Expand earlier messages when you need the
background, then collapse them to focus again.

00:00:08.996 --> 00:00:11.876
These messages are sample history.

00:00:11.876 --> 00:00:16.698
Reading a thread does not send a reply, and a
draft is not a delivered message.
